  "description": "Imagination is my heart. Jiwon likes Seonho, the swimming instructor she meets every morning. At first, it was curiosity, but later, just by making eye contact, she imagines everything to the end. A secret and lovely story that takes place amidst the smell of rocks and the sound of splashing water.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
